00:53:33.830 --> 00:53:38.110
And I think that's partly why people have liked the show over the years is it doesn't

1077
00:53:38.110 --> 00:53:42.050
spell everything out about these characters or about these relationships.

1078
00:53:42.130 --> 00:53:47.710
You kind of acquire a knowledge over time and it becomes more ingrained that way.

1079
00:53:47.890 --> 00:53:52.510
This is sort of off the subject, but you know, you talking about the teapot letter

1080
00:53:52.510 --> 00:53:58.050
and, you know, and I've thought about this many, many times since I left the show that

1081
00:53:58.050 --> 00:54:04.390
you and John, in my opinion, you and John were the, the rock of that show.

1082
00:54:04.550 --> 00:54:11.490
Like if not for your two characters, I feel like that show would have imploded because there

1083
00:54:11.490 --> 00:54:17.230
was, there was so much craziness going on and so much wackiness and you were both such

1084
00:54:17.230 --> 00:54:26.210
grounded characters on that show while simultaneously being incredibly funny and real, but the fact

1085
00:54:26.210 --> 00:54:35.170
