00:54:45.890 --> 00:54:51.350
It's like, we were just so fortunate on so many fronts in terms of the casting of this

1090
00:54:51.350 --> 00:54:56.730
show, in terms of the writing, I attribute it to, well, to you guys, obviously, and to

